  "title": "Classic Texas Caviar",
  "description": "This classic Texas caviar is made with canned black-eyed peas, tomatoes, and veggies tossed in a red wine vinegar dressing with herbs and spices.",
  "authors": [
    "USA WEEKEND columnist Pam Anderson"
